  m_Name: HydrogenBags
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Name: Hydrogen-Filled Gas Bags
  Text: "Fifteen hydrogen-filled gas bags inside the metal frame kept the R-Series
    afloat. These gas bags were arranged from nose to the tail like a peas in a pod.
    In total the gas bags contained 5,500,000 cubic feet of hydrogen. The largest
    bag would fill St. Paul\u2019s dome. To protect the gas bags from rain, wind,
    and sun non-gas-tight cloth cover was attached to the metal frame. \n"
